## Prod-local devtime node — isolated from both dev and deployed
## prod by distinct name + cookie. Long name so it can cluster with
## real beam nodes if the operator needs it (in which case swap the
## cookie to the site cookie temporarily).
-name hecate_prodlocal@host00.lab
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface '{192,168,1,100}'

## Distinct cookie so accidental epmd resolution doesn't let
## prod-local join anything else. Change only when intentionally
## clustering for a specific test.
-setcookie XXZKQDYFJTNBPROLOCALAZC

## No heartbeat — crashes stay crashed (dev ergonomics).
## -heart

## Interactive code server — required for plugin loading.
-mode interactive

## Standard EPMD on the same port as dev; rely on distinct node names
## to avoid collision.
-start_epmd true
-epmd_port 4369

-smp auto
+A 64
+P 1048576
+Q 65536
+sbt db
+SDio 32
